// [62] backend registry routing (): every target from --list-targets (>=7) routes through the
// TargetRegistry to a real emit whose manifest.json records that target; an unregistered target is
// refused with an error whose usage list derives from the registry (names solidity + views). See
// check_registry_routing.py.
//
